Vendored spell-check dictionaries
=================================

These are Hunspell dictionaries, baked into the binary so spell check
works with no configuration and no network access. They are data, not
code, and each keeps its own licence.

Provenance was established from the files and their packaging, not
assumed. Upstream calibre ships its own en-US copy with no attribution
of any kind -- no header, nothing in its COPYRIGHT, nothing in its
build scripts -- so that copy is deliberately NOT used here.


