en-GB/  -- British English MySpell dictionary
----------------------------------------------

Taken from calibre's own resources. Unlike its en-US, this one states
its licence and authorship in its own `en-GB.aff` header:

  "Affix file for British English MySpell dictionary.
   Built from scratch for MySpell. Released under LGPL.
   David Bartlett, Andrew Brown, Marco A.G.Pinto.
   V 3.0.2, 2021-11-01"

Licence: LGPL. The header above is preserved verbatim in the shipped
`en-GB.aff`, so the licence travels with the file.
